5,0,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! I hope we can find the werewolf together.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Hi. I'm a bit nervous, but I'll try my best.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,Let's keep the discussion logical and efficient.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Welcome, dear children. Let's stay calm and kind.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Midori,,I agree. We should listen to each other carefully.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Yumi,,I feel a strong connection to this group. Let's trust each other.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I don't have much to say yet, but I'm listening.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,Silence is fine. We need data before making judgments.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"Your calmness is appreciated, Daisuke. Take your time.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Midori,,I like the peaceful atmosphere so far. Let's maintain it.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm ready to help anyone who needs support.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"Thank you, Yumi. I feel a bit safer now.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,"Support is good, but we need to identify the threat.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Shizue,,Asuka is right. We must be vigilant but gentle.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Midori,,I'll cook for everyone if we survive the night.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"That sounds wonderful, Midori. Let's hope for a good night.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll try to stay awake to watch for anything strange.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Asuka,,Sleeping is inefficient. I will observe the others.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"Rest well, everyone. Peace is our greatest strength.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Midori,,Goodnight. Let's wake up to a safe village.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
