31,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I have a strong suspicion about one person.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Who is it? I'm worried now.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Suspicion without evidence is dangerous.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Please share your thoughts, Yumi. We are here to help.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,I'm listening. Let's find the truth together.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I believe Asuka is the werewolf.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,Asuka? But she seemed so logical.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Asuka,,That is a bold accusation. Do you have proof?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Yumi, are you sure? This is a serious claim.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I trust Yumi's intuition, but let's hear more.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Yumi,,My intuition is my power. I am certain.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I don't know what to think. I feel conflicted.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"If I were the werewolf, I would not reveal it so easily.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shizue,,Asuka has a point. But Yumi is usually right.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,Let's vote based on Yumi's claim for now.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I stand by my word. Asuka is the threat.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I will follow the majority. I'm too scared to decide alone.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Fine. Let's see who believes a child's word over logic.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Let's proceed with the vote. We must act.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,I agree. Let's vote Asuka out.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
